      "id": "HI-C538-sajona",
      "sequence": 29640,
      "title": "सँजोना (sãjonā) — to treasure; to keep with care",
      "headword": "सँजोना",
      "romanization": "sãjonā",
      "gloss": "to treasure; to keep with care",
      "script": "devanagari",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:53be7759c9ca5b14",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Hindi for an auspicious moment (to begin something), then the Hindi for to shift."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: सँजोना",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सँजोना — sãjonā — \"to treasure; to keep with care\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दादी ने पुरानी तस्वीरें एक डिब्बे में सँजोकर रखी हैं। Dādī ne purānī tasvīreṁ ek ḍibbe meṁ sãjokar rakhī haiṁ. Grandmother has kept the old photographs carefully in a box."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने पुरानी चिट्ठियाँ सँजोईं, usne purānī ciṭṭhiyā̃ sãjoīṁ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सँजोना (sãjonā) is a tadbhava, inherited from Sanskrit saṁyōjayati, \"brings together\" (CDIAL 12990). CDIAL gives the Hindi verb as \"to decorate, make ready\"; keeping something with care grew from that."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
