              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *Dādī ne purānī tasvīreṁ ek ḍibbe meṁ sãjokar rakhī haiṁ.* — Grandmother has kept the old photographs carefully in a box.]"
            },
            {
