              "text": "सजना — sajnā — \"to be decorated; to be dressed up\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शादी के लिए पूरा घर सज रहा है। Śādī ke liye pūrā ghar saj rahā hai. The whole house is being decorated for the wedding."
            },
